# Normalise line endings in the repo. Working copies stay native (CRLF on Windows),
# but everything committed is LF, so diffs stay clean across machines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Lockfiles are generated; collapse them in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
